{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24800","headline":"中元日观法事 · 卢拱","name":"中元日观法事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四孟逢秋序，三元得气中。\n云迎碧落步，章奏玉皇宫。\n坛滴槐花露，香飘栢子风。\n羽衣凌缥缈，瑶毂辗虚空。\n久慕餐霞客，常悲习蓼虫。\n青囊如可授，从此访鸿蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢拱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}